<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 168.7 mln reais net inflow March 1-20.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 168.7 mln reais net inflow March 1-20.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it registered foreign capital inflows of 168.764 million reais in the first 20 days of March.</p>
<p>Foreign buys amounted to 2.338 billion reais, against foreign sales of 2.169 billion reais, the bolsa said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign capital inflows have totalled 1.011 billion reais. In February, net inflows amounted to 842.630 million reais.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
